<title>EGYPT: Misr Cotton Ginning end-Q3 results.</title>
<headline>Misr Cotton Ginning end-Q3 results.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the first nine months of the financial year 1996/7, which started on July 1:</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds, no comparative figures available):</p>
<p>Net sales			   144,180,389</p>
<p>Production costs		  140,476,598</p>
<p>Net profit    before tax	  3,703,791</p>
<p>(Full company name is Misr Cotton Ginning)</p>
<p>$1 =3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
